.TH EMERALD.MASK 5 "2026-09-07" "@PROJECT_NAME@" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
@PROJECT_NAME@.mask \- ports excluded from system upgrades
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I @SYSCONFDIR@/@PROJECT_NAME@.mask
contains package or port names that \fB@PROJECT_NAME@ sysup\fR must not upgrade. Each entry is a single name on its own line.
.SH FORMAT
.EX
# one port per line
linux-firmware
some-port
.EE
.PP
Blank lines and lines beginning with \fB#\fR are ignored. Names are matched as package names; an installed version may be shown by \fB@PROJECT_NAME@ mask list\fR.
.SH MANAGEMENT
Use \fB@PROJECT_NAME@ mask list\fR, \fB@PROJECT_NAME@ mask add PORT...\fR, and \fB@PROJECT_NAME@ mask remove PORT...\fR. Changes require root privileges.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR @PROJECT_NAME@ (1)
